lade\\\" with code WB-55 and a Buyer searches \\\"wiper\\\" then The create response status is 201 and the returned search list contains Wiper Blade\",\n    \"Given Product WB-55 exists when The administrator creates another product with code WB-55 then The response status is 409 and the error names the duplicate product code\",\n    \"Given Product WB-55 is on an existing order when The administrator retires WB-55, a Buyer searches \\\"WB-55\\\" and opens the order then The returned search list does not contain WB-55 and the returned order detail still contains its line with name and price\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"The portal shall let administrators create, rename and retire single-level categories and assign each product to one category, hiding retired categories from the Buyer category filter.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given A signed-in Administrator when The administrator creates category \\\"Lighting\\\" and assigns product X to it then The returned category list contains Lighting and a Buyer catalogue filtered by Lighting returns a list containing X\",\n    \"Given Category Lighting when The administrator retires it and a Buyer lists categories then The returned category list does not contain Lighting\",\n    \"Given A signed-in Administrator when A category 'Filters' is created with a parent category id then The response status is 400 with error code NESTED_CATEGORY_NOT_SUPPORTED\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"When an administrator uploads a product image, the portal shall store it in cloud storage as the product's image, replacing any previous image, only if it is a JPEG, PNG or WebP file of at most 10 MB.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given Product X with an existing image when The administrator uploads a 2 MB PNG then The response status is 200 and the product's returned imageUrl value points to the new image\",\n    \"Given Product X when The administrator uploads an 11 MB JPEG and then a GIF then Both responses are rejection statuse